From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 01:10:17 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 58/76] flashnext cuda: a pipeline stage's sequences hold only
 its own layers' state

A stage's sequence allocated every layer's DeltaNet state and attention
caches, so --pp 2 needed a whole model's stream bytes on each rank and
refused --parallel 16 at a 139,264-token window. Each entry for another
stage's layer is now empty, keeping the arrays' indexing, and the budget
counts a stage's stream bytes from its own layers.
